{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🌋 GeoCongo AI — Démonstration 3D & Analyse de Forages (v0.2.0)\n",
    "\n",
    "Ce notebook illustre l'utilisation du **GeoCongo AI SDK v0.2.0** pour :\n",
    "1. L'ingestion et la validation de jeux de données de forages géologiques (`DrillholeDataset`).\n",
    "2. Le calcul des trajectoires 3D et le clustering spatial DBSCAN (`geocongoai.analysis`).\n",
    "3. L'utilisation du contrat universel `GeoResult` pour l'export JSON, GeoJSON, HTML et DataFrame.\n",
    "4. La visualisation 3D interactive directement dans le Notebook (`result.show_3d()`)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 1. Chargement du SDK GeoCongo AI\n",
    "from geocongoai import DrillholeDataset, GeoResult\n",
    "import pandas as pd"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Création du Dataset de Forages (`DrillholeDataset`)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Données de démonstration : Colliers de forages\n",
    "collars = [\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": "DH01\", \"x\": 500000.0, \"y\": 9200000.0, \"z\": 120.0, \"dip\": -90, \"azimuth\": 0},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH02\", \"x\": 500025.0, \"y\": 9200015.0, \"z\": 122.0, \"dip\": -85, \"azimuth\": 45},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH03\", \"x": 500050.0, \"y\": 9200030.0, \"z\": 118.0, \"dip\": -90, \"azimuth\": 0},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH04\", \"x\": 500200.0, \"y\": 9200150.0, \"z\": 110.0, \"dip\": -90, \"azimuth\": 0},\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Données d'analyses géochimiques (Assays)\n",
    "assays = [\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH01\", \"from_m\": 0, \"to_m\": 10, \"cu_pct\": 1.45, \"co_pct\": 0.08},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH01\", \"from_m\": 10, \"to_m\": 20, \"cu_pct": 1.80, \"co_pct\": 0.12},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH01\", \"from_m\": 20, \"to_m\": 30, \"cu_pct\": 0.30, \"co_pct\": 0.01},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH02\", \"from_m\": 0, \"to_m": 12, \"cu_pct\": 1.30, \"co_pct\": 0.07},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH02\", \"from_m\": 12, \"to_m\": 25, \"cu_pct\": 1.65, \"co_pct\": 0.10},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH03\", \"from_m\": 0, \"to_m\": 15, \"cu_pct\": 1.55, \"co_pct\": 0.09},\n",
    "    {\"hole_id\": \"DH04\", \"from_m\": 0, \"to_m\": 15, \"cu_pct\": 0.15, \"co_pct\": 0.01},\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Instanciation du DrillholeDataset\n",
    "dataset = DrillholeDataset(collars=collars, assays=assays)\n",
    "print(\"Résumé du Dataset :\")\n",
    "print(dataset.info())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Analyse Spatiale 3D & DBSCAN"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Lancement de l'analyse avec seuil de teneur Cu >= 0.5%\n",
    "result = dataset.analyze(\n",
    "    method=\"dbscan\",\n",
    "    element=\"cu_pct\",\n",
    "    grade_threshold=0.5,\n",
    "    eps=60.0,\n",
    "    min_samples=2\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Métadonnées du résultat :\", result.metadata)\n",
    "print(\"Statistiques géochimiques :\", result.statistics)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Visualisation 3D Interactive dans Jupyter"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Affichage du modèle 3D Plotly\n",
    "fig = result.show_3d(title=\"Gisement de Cuivre - GeoCongo AI\")\n",
    "fig"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Exports Multi-formats (JSON, GeoJSON, HTML, DataFrame)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Exportation en fichier HTML autonome pour le partage sans serveur\n",
    "result.to_html(\"forages_3d_demo.html\")\n",
    "print(\"Fichier HTML autonome généré : forages_3d_demo.html\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Exportation au format JSON universel pour FastAPI / React\n",
    "json_str = result.to_json(indent=2)\n",
    "print(\"Aperçu JSON (500 premiers caractères) :\")\n",
    "print(json_str[:500])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Exportation en DataFrame Pandas\n",
    "df = result.to_dataframe()\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  }
 ],
